OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerous' doctor struck off
OL,4,Aafter failing to quit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor found by a tribunal to be "a
OL,7,Fdanger to the public" can no longer
OL,8,Fpractice medicine.
OL,10,FDr Jan Mozny was suspended in April
OL,11,F2023 for failing six patients in March
OL,12,F2020, when he was a locum consultant
OL,13,Fspecialising in medical oncology for
OL,14,Fthe University Hospitals of Derby and
OL,15,FBurton NHS Foundation Trust.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
