OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerous' doctor struck off
OL,4,Aafter failing to quit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tribunal ruled he had prescribed
OL,7,Fchemotherapy with no correspondence,
OL,8,Fprescribed the wrong course of
OL,9,Ftreatment for another patient, while a
OL,10,Fthird was seen but no paperwork was
OL,11,Fdone and they were not given their CT
OL,12,Fscan results.
OL,14,FFor this misconduct, Mozny had been
OL,15,Fgiven a series of suspensions to
OL,16,Fvoluntarily leave the profession but a
OL,17,Ftribunal on Friday erased him from the
OL,18,FMedical Register.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
